      "created_at": "2018-08-21T21:45:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, she's not as fast as she used to be, so not everything in a city, but probably everything in the scene unless it's flying or something.&nbsp; I agree, as a Green ability it seems fairly ridiculous.&nbsp; In the PbP we started, I discovered that putting a large bonus or two on Tachyon can erase every minion in a scene in round 1 fairly reliably.&nbsp; A couple of the Daybreak heroes also have unrestricted mass attacks, but at least they're all Yellow.</p>",
